cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DEGASv3, please cite the software and the DEGAS publications below."
title: "DEGASv3"
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-09"
authors:
  - given-names: "Justin"
    family-names: "Couetil"
  - name: "the DEGAS team"
abstract: >-
  DEGASv3 transfers patient-level outcomes from bulk RNA-seq onto single-cell
  or spatial transcriptomic data with the DEGAS deep transfer-learning model,
  then compares high-score and low-score cells within each cluster.
keywords:
  - transfer learning
  - single-cell
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - DEGAS
